WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.634
The first people.

00:02.334 --> 00:07.504
Neil Armstrong and Buzz Aldrin stayed 21 hours and 36 minutes.

00:07.954 --> 00:15.544
Their whole walk covered about 250 metres, and neither went more than about 100 m from the lander.

00:15.994 --> 00:18.867
Michael Collins waited for them in orbit.
